sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor VD as Vendor
    participant VP as Vendor Portal
    participant PS as Product Service
    participant AQ as Approval Queue
    actor QC as QC / Admin
    participant SA as Shopify Adapter
    participant SP as Shopify
    participant AU as Audit Log

    Note over VD,AU: Requirement 8.1 - new products need approval -<br/>stock and price updates go live WITHOUT approval.

    alt vendor uploads a NEW product
        VD->>VP: upload product (images, description, variants, price)
        VP->>PS: submit
        PS->>PS: validate (required fields, image count, size chart)
        Note right of PS: "Missing size chart" appears 127x<br/>as a return reason. Making it a<br/>required field at upload is the<br/>cheapest possible fix.
        PS->>PS: status = Pending Approval
        PS->>AQ: enqueue for QC
        PS->>AU: log submission

        QC->>AQ: review
        alt approved
            QC->>PS: approve
            PS->>SA: publish to Shopify
            SA->>SP: productCreate + variants
            SP-->>SA: product id
            PS->>PS: status = Live
            PS->>VD: notify - product live
        else rejected
            QC->>PS: reject with reason
            PS->>VD: notify - rejected + what to fix
            Note right of VD: Vendor edits and resubmits.<br/>Nothing reaches the storefront<br/>without QC. (Req 8.1)
        end

    else vendor updates STOCK or PRICE
        VD->>VP: update stock / price
        VP->>PS: apply immediately
        PS->>SA: sync to Shopify
        SA->>SP: inventorySetQuantities / variant price update
        PS->>AU: log old value -> new value
        Note right of PS: No approval gate - explicitly<br/>allowed by Req 8.1. Speed matters<br/>more than control here. The audit<br/>log provides accountability.

    else vendor edits an EXISTING product's content
        VD->>VP: edit title / images / description
        VP->>PS: create pending revision
        PS->>AQ: enqueue for QC
        Note right of AQ: The live product stays live on<br/>the old content until approved -<br/>no storefront gap.
    end

    PS->>AU: INSERT AUDIT_LOG<br/>(user, timestamp, old_value, new_value)
    Note over AU: Requirement 12.4 - full accountability<br/>for every vendor-initiated change.
